  "description": "Big & bad, the Fit CR29 is a full-scale BMX machine for salty veterans of the two-wheeled battlefield or those just looking to cruise the streets. Kitted out in vintage YZ-inspired livery, the CRs are moto-influenced and ready to roll. 100% chromoly frame, 4-piece bars with a comfy 7″ rise and an upright Fit top load stem. Seating arrangements come in the way of an S&M Sharpie Shield railed seat and micro-adjust post. On the rubber side, you’re rolling smooth and fast on S&M Speedball tires in the plus sized 29″ X 2.4″ spec, mounted on double-wall alloy rims with sealed hubs front and rear. 3-piece 175mm cranks and 36/17 gearing get you there, with new V-brakes in the rear to slow your roll. Add a “Hurricane” frame pad for a true motocross feel and you have a bike that’s big, fast and fun. What else do you need?",
